  "bio": "Zoran Trajkovski is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in black and gray realism, offering clients stunningly detailed artwork from the quaint town of Kolding, Denmark. As a co-founder of Ink.sters and based on the information from their booking details in Munich, Germany, Zoran is recognized for their professionalism both in managing session bookings and in the meticulous execution of each tattoo masterpiece. Clients praise the commitment to their craft and the seamless experience from initial contact to the finished piece.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Kolding, Southern Denmark Region, Denmark"
